# basic-entries

## Input

```
key value
name hello world
port 8080
flag true

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..47
  ENTRY@0..10
    WORD_KEY@0..3
      WORD@0..3 "key"
    SPACE@3..4 " "
    LINE_STRING@4..9
      STRING@4..9 "value"
    NEWLINE@9..10 "\n"
  ENTRY@10..27
    WORD_KEY@10..14
      WORD@10..14 "name"
    SPACE@14..15 " "
    LINE_STRING@15..26
      STRING@15..26 "hello world"
    NEWLINE@26..27 "\n"
  ENTRY@27..37
    WORD_KEY@27..31
      WORD@27..31 "port"
    SPACE@31..32 " "
    INTEGER@32..36
      NUMERAL@32..36 "8080"
    NEWLINE@36..37 "\n"
  ENTRY@37..47
    WORD_KEY@37..41
      WORD@37..41 "flag"
    SPACE@41..42 " "
    BOOLEAN@42..46
      TRUE@42..46 "true"
    NEWLINE@46..47 "\n"
```

## AST

```
SourceFile {
    items: [
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@0..3 "key",
            },
            value: LineString {
                string: STRING@4..9 "value",
            },
        },
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@10..14 "name",
            },
            value: LineString {
                string: STRING@15..26 "hello world",
            },
        },
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@27..31 "port",
            },
            value: Integer {
                sign: none,
                numeral: NUMERAL@32..36 "8080",
            },
        },
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@37..41 "flag",
            },
            value: Boolean {
                token: TRUE@42..46 "true",
            },
        },
    ],
}
```

